(7523740, 1202571, 65234, '<td valign="top">One of those "if these walls could talk" images. The poor shall always be with us.</td>', 'One of those "if these walls could talk" images. The poor shall always be with us.', '2017-07-16 13:30:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7523741, 1202299, 65234, '<td valign="top">I always wonder just how far to stray from reality in processing for these challenges. This ... works for me. I don''t know if it was interesting as a photograph, but as a finished image it''s something I''d happily hang on a wall. I just can''t help wondering what''s there in the darkness behind those ladders; it can''t be anything sinister with those gorgeous pastels and bright sunlight.</td>', 'I always wonder just how far to stray from reality in processing for these challenges. This ... works for me. I don''t know if it was interesting as a photograph, but as a finished image it''s something I''d happily hang on a wall. I just can''t help wondering what''s there in the darkness behind those ladders; it can''t be anything sinister with those gorgeous pastels and bright sunlight.', '2017-07-16 13:34:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7523743, 1202341, 65234, '<td valign="top">OMG, look at those nails! Except for the thumbs, so as many talons as your average bird. Fun, fun concept and execution. I''m enjoying exploring the background :-) Very Alice in Wonderland.</td>', 'OMG, look at those nails! Except for the thumbs, so as many talons as your average bird. Fun, fun concept and execution. I''m enjoying exploring the background :-) Very Alice in Wonderland.', '2017-07-16 13:36:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7523744, 1202568, 65234, '<td valign="top">This loaded a little slowly for me so I had extra time to study the spider =:-O And those poor, clueless, innocent people. ::shudder:: You have successfully creeped me out!</td>', 'This loaded a little slowly for me so I had extra time to study the spider =:-O And those poor, clueless, innocent people. ::shudder:: You have successfully creeped me out!', '2017-07-16 13:38:49.000000', NULL, 1),
