(7523753, 1202565, 65234, '<td valign="top">Pretty scene. I feel like this would benefit from an HDR or similar treatment to really bring out the tonal range. And the horizon feels tilted, so I keep cocking my head to look at the image.</td>', 'Pretty scene. I feel like this would benefit from an HDR or similar treatment to really bring out the tonal range. And the horizon feels tilted, so I keep cocking my head to look at the image.', '2017-07-16 13:51:49.000000', NULL, 1),
