(7523756, 1202566, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice detail on the gull''s body, head and tail, and I like the composition and framing. Kind of want either more or less motion blur on the wings, though. From a DOF perspective it comes off a bit disconcerting to have the head and tail so sharp but not the wings. Sort of like how I react to a tilted horizon - either straighten it out or tilt it so much it''s clearly a choice the photographer made. The blur on the wings is affecting me the same way.</td>', 'Nice detail on the gull''s body, head and tail, and I like the composition and framing. Kind of want either more or less motion blur on the wings, though. From a DOF perspective it comes off a bit disconcerting to have the head and tail so sharp but not the wings. Sort of like how I react to a tilted horizon - either straighten it out or tilt it so much it''s clearly a choice the photographer made. The blur on the wings is affecting me the same way.', '2017-07-16 14:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7523757, 1201523, 65234, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but motion-blurred vegetables just aren''t all that interesting to me.</td>', 'Sorry, but motion-blurred vegetables just aren''t all that interesting to me.', '2017-07-16 14:17:34.000000', NULL, 1),
