(7524438, 1202503, 30364, '<td valign="top">I tried to decide if I''d prefer this lively picture with just one (and if that, which one?) of the two Fiddle Sisters in shot.  Nope, I like it better this way.  Plus they can play two parts of the music this way.  Sounds great! Thank you.</td>', 'I tried to decide if I''d prefer this lively picture with just one (and if that, which one?) of the two Fiddle Sisters in shot.  Nope, I like it better this way.  Plus they can play two parts of the music this way.  Sounds great! Thank you.', '2017-07-20 03:41:38.000000', NULL, 1),
