(7524491, 1202577, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is my favourite of the challenge, and by a handy stretch too.  Against the depicted and merely cited patriotic iconography  the stuff of brassy celebrations, of tub-thumping and facile expression  you have juxtaposed a plainly-lovely, contemplative girl (could be a young boy I suppose; doesn''t matter). And you''ve done it in monochrome too!  Such wonderful contradictions, such absorbing counterpoint.  A work of love and circumspection together. Patriotism for grown-ups, which is just what America needs at the moment. 10. Thank you.<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=800078" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_800078.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_800078.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_800078.jpg"/></a></td>', 'This is my favourite of the challenge, and by a handy stretch too.  Against the depicted and merely cited patriotic iconography  the stuff of brassy celebrations, of tub-thumping and facile expression  you have juxtaposed a plainly-lovely, contemplative girl (could be a young boy I suppose; doesn''t matter). And you''ve done it in monochrome too!  Such wonderful contradictions, such absorbing counterpoint.  A work of love and circumspection together. Patriotism for grown-ups, which is just what America needs at the moment. 10. Thank you.', '2017-07-20 14:39:45.000000', NULL, 1),
