(7524885, 1202525, 68504, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by streetpigeon:</b></div><hr/><i> Lines, lines, lines, but they seem more woven according to arcane structural rules than awkwardly haphazard.  Amidst it all, the serenity of the woman at the table.  A co-favorite. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I agree.</td>', 'Originally posted by streetpigeon: Lines, lines, lines, but they seem more woven according to arcane structural rules than awkwardly haphazard.  Amidst it all, the serenity of the woman at the table.  A co-favorite.   I agree.', '2017-07-23 03:22:34.000000', NULL, 0),
