(7524890, 1202572, 68504, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by streetpigeon:</b></div><hr/><i> I''m enjoying this well-composed, understated everyday moment.  Only when you examine this a bit do you see that the man is in what may very well be a gurney.  It resonates more than any straightforward depiction can. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>exactly.</td>', 'Originally posted by streetpigeon: I''m enjoying this well-composed, understated everyday moment.  Only when you examine this a bit do you see that the man is in what may very well be a gurney.  It resonates more than any straightforward depiction can.   exactly.', '2017-07-23 03:33:49.000000', NULL, 0),
