(7524930, 1202256, 83149, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by tnun:</b></div><hr/><i> good title. I don''t suppose there''s any point in pointing out that the "busy" cables are the point; or that the cables themselves were revolutionary  and made the whole colossus possible. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I know, I really didn''t know how to respond to that comment.</td>', 'Originally posted by tnun: good title. I don''t suppose there''s any point in pointing out that the "busy" cables are the point; or that the cables themselves were revolutionary  and made the whole colossus possible.   I know, I really didn''t know how to respond to that comment.', '2017-07-23 10:13:58.000000', NULL, 0),
