(7525110, 1202526, 30982, '<td valign="top">This is quite amazing - well worth the work!</td>', 'This is quite amazing - well worth the work!', '2017-07-24 02:55:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(7525197, 1202597, 19825, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully assembled scene. I especially love the background with its color palette and texture --  it adds much for me. Many would have focused all of there efforts on assembling Humpty and left the background as an afterthought. Nicely done.</td>', 'Wonderfully assembled scene. I especially love the background with its color palette and texture --  it adds much for me. Many would have focused all of there efforts on assembling Humpty and left the background as an afterthought. Nicely done.', '2017-07-24 11:03:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(7525204, 1202526, 96664, '<td valign="top">This is just ridiculous... Stunning in every way. The deep colors of the sky slowly changing into a "sunset" style color just about the skyline. The bursts of color coming from each individual town. The leading line of the river flowing through the entire foreground giving your eye somewhere to go as it takes it all in. Perhaps my favorite image thus far in 2017. Beautiful.</td>', 'This is just ridiculous... Stunning in every way. The deep colors of the sky slowly changing into a "sunset" style color just about the skyline. The bursts of color coming from each individual town. The leading line of the river flowing through the entire foreground giving your eye somewhere to go as it takes it all in. Perhaps my favorite image thus far in 2017. Beautiful.', '2017-07-24 11:39:23.000000', NULL, 0);
COMMIT;
